  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pax Christi- Women and Water Governance for Peace Building in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the knowledge of women human rights and environmental defenders in Colombia on community water governance for fostering Peace with social and environmental justice.
1.Train 30 women leaders from diverse regions on water governance for fair and democratic transitions, contributing to Peace with social and environmental justice.
2.Train 100 women leaders from various demographic, ethnic, age, political, cultural, and social groups on community water governance in land use planning, using tools for active citizenship and peacebuilding.
3. Showcase the initiatives of 10 women leading community water governance, land defense, and territory building for Peace.</narrative>
  </description>
